        "notes": "You play as an angry beaver who solves problems the only way he knows how \u2014 by biting off limbs. Humans explode into low-poly chunks, heads roll (literally), and sometimes our furry friend gets pancaked by a car or blown up by a bomb. It\u2019s all cartoon chaos with zero realism and maximum ridiculousness.\r\n\r\n"
